[00:18.160]Hi, it's been a while
[00:23.385]since the last time that I saw your smile
[00:31.549]What a perfect fit
[00:35.047]The last piece have fallen into its place
[00:41.068]I've been craving to touch you
[00:44.716]like moonlight stroking your face
[00:48.734]My dear reverie, come hold me near
[00:56.243]Come dance with me
[00:59.941]in rosy haze of yesterday
[01:04.713]Reverie, don't drift away
[01:10.311]Please keep me here in your warm embrace
[01:18.438]I'll trade anything
[01:21.686]for you, for one more day
[01:55.054]I'll perfume your dreams
[02:00.223]with scent of flowers and summer breeze
[02:08.557]Does it matter if it's true
[02:13.917]It feels a lot more real
[02:17.788]when we whistle through the fields
[02:21.766]when I sing this song for you
[02:25.611]My dear reverie, come hold me near
[02:32.990]Come dance with me
[02:36.447]in rosy haze of yesterday
[02:41.173]Reverie, don't let me go
[02:47.698]If sanity means I have to hit the road
[02:54.868]Then I don't wanna know
[02:58.760]anywhere the wind blows
[00:18.160]嗨好久不见
[00:23.385]自从上次看见你的笑容
[00:31.549]多完美的契合
[00:35.047]拼上了最后一块拼图
[00:41.068]我一直渴望触碰你
[00:44.716]像月光一样轻抚你的脸颊
[00:48.734]亲爱的幻想曲，把我拉近你吧
[00:56.243]和我在往日的
[00:59.941]玫瑰色雾霭中舞蹈
[01:04.713]幻想曲，不要飘走
[01:10.311]请把我留在你温暖的怀抱里
[01:18.438]我愿意倾尽所有
[01:21.686]再续上一天和你的时光
[01:55.054]我会在你的梦境里
[02:00.223]喷上花和夏日清风的香氛
[02:08.557]真假重要吗
[02:13.917]一切感觉真实多了
[02:17.788]当我们吹着口哨穿过田野
[02:21.766]当我为你唱这首歌
[02:25.611]亲爱的幻想曲，把我拉近你吧
[02:32.990]和我在往日的
[02:36.447]玫瑰色雾霭中舞蹈
[02:41.173]幻想曲，不要放手
[02:47.698]如果清醒意味着我要重新出发
[02:54.868]那我连风吹向何处
[02:58.760]都不想知道
